              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "म्हैं दिवाळी घरै मनाई। mhaĩ divāḷī gharai manāī. I celebrated Diwali at home."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): म्हैं होळी मनाई, mhaĩ hoḷī manāī."
