              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मनावणो (manāvṇo) is inherited from Sanskrit manyate, \"thinks, honours\"; CDIAL lists Old Marwari manāvaï, \"persuades\", under it. \"To celebrate\" a feast is probably \"to honour\" it (CDIAL 9857)."
